# Durable project context

- Use the existing relevant project note for a lasting business decision, migration instruction, or behavior future work depends on.
- When Vault exists and has an applicable feature note, update the small affected section.
- When Vault is absent, use the established Docs file if the task requires documentation.
- Keep changes factual, concise, and limited to the requested work. Record actual verification and remaining checks accurately.
- A missing Vault does not need a recurring response footer.
